     5581     view stream Out-stream frame Bottomframe-corr .
     5582   form with frame factur-corr .
     5583   END.
     5584   ELSE DO:
     5585   form header
     5586       v-single-line format "X(199)" at 1 skip
     5587       "Продолжение - на следующей странице" at 30 skip
     5588       with frame Bottomframe width 235 page-bottom no-labels no-box .
     5589   view stream Out-stream frame Bottomframe .
     5590   form with frame factur .
     5591     display stream out-stream
     5592    sym1  "                     1                    " @ goods.gds-name
     5593    sym2  "  1а  " @ v-uaes-code
     5594    sym16 " 2  "   @ v-unit-code
     5595    sym14 "    2а     "     @ goods.unit-base
     5596    sym3  "     3     " @ v-qnty
     5597    sym4  "      4     " @ v-price-no-VAT
     5598    sym5  "        5        " @ v-sum-no-VAT
     5599    sym6  "     6    " @ v-sum-actciz
     5600    sym7  "   7  " @ doc-line.Vat-pc
     5601    sym8  "      8     " @ v-VAT
