     7382                           with frame corr-factur .
     7383                           run facturxl-write-line-data-corr in this-procedure (
     7384                               input (if rep-artic then (string(ub.goods.artic,"x(16)") +  " ") else "") + ub.goods.gds-name
     7385                             , input "А (до изменения)"
     7386                             , input v-uaes-code
